<item>
<ptxt>Be sure to perform G sensor 0 point learning first, and then perform CVT hydraulic pressure learning.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Be sure to place the vehicle on a level surface and perform 0 point learning.</ptxt>
</item>
